.TH PROFILES 1 2000-1月 "sort_profiles" "sort_profiles"
.SH NAME
sort_profiles \- Keep only the top n terms of each catalog of the given catalog profiles.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIsort_profiles(\fBprofile\fR as <generic> CatalogProfiles, 
\fBtop\fR as integer = 10);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Keep only the top n terms of each catalog of the given catalog profiles.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBprofile\fB \fR\- the catalog profiles object, for example the result of the \fBKEGG.enrichment.profile\fR function.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtop\fB \fR\- the number of the terms that will be kept in each catalog. Default \fB10\fR.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a new [CatalogProfiles](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.ComponentModel.Annotation.CatalogProfiles) object that only contains the top n terms of each catalog.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
profiles
